menu "Router watchdog internet check"

    config RW_INET_INTERVAL
        int "Check interval while online (s)"
        range 10 3600
        default 30

    config RW_INET_FAIL_ROUNDS
        int "Failed rounds before going offline"
        range 1 10
        default 2
        help
            Consecutive failed rounds needed to switch from online to offline when public pings still pass. A total outage switches after one round. Failed rounds repeat every 10 s.

endmenu
